      "uid": "zhcn:e7155f5a7a6a49b8b43fee63",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "──自信。实力就不用说了，\n若是没有“自己绝对是最强的！”这种自信，\n是无法在大舞台竞争的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "00d0d4510a2d91203c064d7c706c24b4213b07e0580065dd3e1aa771193daee6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
