    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6ecca69390ca40bda0825086",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "那里满是我们的美好回忆。\n而且──",
      "source_fingerprint": "0b5fde21ec25292b9c2def6333eb0af168adbfa2bd91bbd67d94d98e9a333e3e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1066/storytimeline_501066304.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        43,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/43/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:da6b9a3ba55448d9c25e55a1",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "福岛赛场很适合双涡轮。\n有急弯，最后的直线也很短，\n最适合终点前的加速并不快的双涡轮。",
      "source_fingerprint": "df882c872e0687fae1c8c1beda6c57d39bb105d995972911e557cd09aa2f205f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1066/storytimeline_501066304.json",
      "json_path": [
