      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "问题是要以哪个比赛为目标。\n若要以重赏比赛为目标，就是在初夏举办的──",
      "source_fingerprint": "f3e02ccf381ffa162253871df618351fc47e41b174b3d578517e62f08f478fd5",
