    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:de711d84204521e1b8a956f0",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "视她的状态出场也可以。\n只是感觉别设为目标，\n对双涡轮会比较好。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2df92324b36353a663a8baa1e4ae45764d657ee3501e45602d178faecca529f8",
